) to full-time equivalent instructional faculty (full time plus 1/3 part time). In the ratio calculations, exclude both faculty and students in stand-alone graduate or professional programs such as medicine, law, veterinary, dentistry, social work, busine
ss, or public health in which faculty teach virtually only graduate level students. Do not count undergraduate or graduate student teaching assistants as faculty.
\par 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cf1\insrsid7743896\charrsid9774027 Fall }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cf1\insrsid7952518 2017}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cf1\insrsid9600684\charrsid9774027  Student to Fac}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 
